    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just the shame of it all. i keep thinking about everyone i know, seeing the way they look at people who fail like this. it's like once you hit a certain level of ruin, you're just a ghost. i'm just terrified of the actual moment of the crash, seeing it all play out in real time until there's nothing left to save.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
