      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shame you're feeling is a heavy weight, but it doesn't define your entire worth. Remember that setbacks and failures are part of the human experience, and they don't erase who you are as a person. If you feel overwhelmed by the fear of what's coming, please consider speaking with a mental health professional who can offer a safe space to process these intense emotions. There is support available to help you through this.",
      "source": "target",
